    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01J8SSY2V7WN61KXP4BY7TZB17\">You will learn </h2>\n<p>Learn how Klaviyo calculates sentiment trends for reviews. This AI-driven analysis identifies changes in what reviewers are saying about your products and brand, so you can respond quickly and make improvements where needed. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J8SSY2V767CG611JBR9GRCDV\">How to opt in to sentiment trend analysis</h2>\n<p>The features described in this article require opt in. To enable these features in your account: </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Reviews</strong>. </li>\n<li>Select the <strong>Performance</strong> tab. </li>\n<li>Scroll to the <em>Review sentiment</em> card. </li>\n<li>Select <strong>Enable sentiment analysis</strong>. </li>\n<li>Select an industry from the dropdown. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Save</strong>. </li>\n</ol>\n<p>You can change your industry at any time by selecting <strong>Change industry</strong> next to your industry in the <em>Review sentiment</em> card. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J8SSY2V7HF0KWX11DDQQAQ7A\">About sentiment trend analysis</h2>\n<p>Sentiment trend analysis flags changes in what people are saying from month to month. For example, your June trend report might indicate that your overall sentiment for product fit is positive but that your latest product drop has started to bring that average down. Your all-time customer sentiment for product fit could still be high, but if it begins trending downward, sentiment trend analysis can alert you quickly so you can make changes right away. </p>\n<p>Access your sentiment trend report by navigating to the <strong>Reviews</strong> tab and scrolling to the <strong>[Month] trend report</strong> card. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/29581552274075\" alt=\"A sample trend report\" width=\"684\" height=\"297\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01J8SSY2V7Y4CBH9V8DYHFM38P\">How sentiment trends are identified </h3>\n<p>Klaviyo identifies trends using a combination of statistical analysis and natural language processing (AI). Every time you receive a review, Klaviyo determines whether that review’s sentiment is positive or negative and assigns the review a topic (e.g., shipping, fit, taste, customer service) based on the review text. These topics vary based on your industry and the products you sell. </p>\n<p>Then, each month, Klaviyo uses statistical tools to identify any abrupt or significant changes in sentiment for each topic compared to past months. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J8SSY2V75Y14MZ5GY67WJJY9\">Limitations of sentiment trend identification </h2>\n<p>If sentiment trend analysis is not available in your account, you may not have qualifying data. Sentiment trend analysis is only available if your account has all of the following: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Historical data</strong><br>\nIn order to identify trends, Klaviyo’s AI models must have access to several months of review history. If you recently began using Klaviyo Reviews, you may not have access to review sentiment trends for 2-3 months. </li>\n<li>\n<strong>Notable changes</strong><br>\nIf there are no notable changes in the content of your reviews from month to month, you won’t see a trend report, because there are no changes to report on. </li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sufficient reviews volume</strong><br>\nKlaviyo’s models need a sufficient volume of reviews in order to produce statistically significant results. If you have few reviews in a month, sentiment analysis trends will not be available to you. </li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J8SSY2V7WBB1HX32VRWX6M0S\">How to access your reviews sentiment analysis</h2>\n<p>See your sentiment analysis by navigating to <strong>Reviews &gt; Overview</strong> and viewing the <em>[Month] trend report</em> card. This card only appears if Klaviyo identifies at least 1 sentiment trend in your account for the current month. </p>\n<p>Additionally, you can opt in to monthly email notifications when a new sentiment analysis report is available. To enable the email summary: </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Reviews &gt; Review settings</strong>. </li>\n<li>Select <strong>Notifications</strong>. </li>\n<li>Enable the <em>Monthly trend report</em> option. </li>\n<li>Select <strong>Save</strong>. </li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J8SSY2V7SF75SRDFKHTYHFJ8\">Industries and topics</h2>\n<p>The chart below outlines the industries available to choose from, as well as the topics available for each industry. Where applicable, the term in parentheses indicates the shorthand for the topic, which is used in charts and event metadata. </p>\n<p></p>\n<table style=\"width: 100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5714%\"><strong>Industry</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.2857%\"><strong>Topics</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5714%\"><strong>General</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.2857%\">\n<p>Accuracy of Product Description (Description)</p>\n<p>Product Appearance (Appearance)</p>\n<p>Customer Service</p>\n<p>Product Packaging (Packaging)</p>\n<p>Product Price and Value (Value)</p>\n<p>Quality and Effectiveness (Quality)</p>\n<p>Shipping and Delivery (Shipping)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5714%\"><strong>Housewares, Home Furnishings &amp; Garden</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.2857%\">\n<p>Accuracy of Product Description (Description)</p>\n<p>Product Appearance (Appearance)</p>\n<p>Customer Service</p>\n<p>Ease of Use</p>\n<p>Product Packaging (Packaging)</p>\n<p>Product Price and Value (Value)</p>\n<p>Quality and Effectiveness (Quality)</p>\n<p>Shipping and Delivery (Shipping)</p>\n<p>Product Size and Quantity (Size)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5714%\"><strong>Health &amp; Beauty</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.2857%\">\n<p>Accuracy of Product Description (Description)</p>\n<p>Product Appearance (Appearance)</p>\n<p>Customer Service</p>\n<p>Product Ingredients (Ingredients)</p>\n<p>Product Packaging (Packaging)</p>\n<p>Product Price and Value (Value)</p>\n<p>Quality and Effectiveness (Quality)</p>\n<p>Shipping and Delivery (Shipping)</p>\n<p>Product Size and Quantity (Size)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5714%\"><strong>Food &amp; Beverage</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.2857%\">\n<p>Accuracy of Product Description (Description)</p>\n<p>Product Appearance (Appearance)</p>\n<p>Customer Service</p>\n<p>Product Flavor</p>\n<p>Product Ingredients (Ingredients)</p>\n<p>Product Packaging (Packaging)</p>\n<p>Product Price and Value (Value)</p>\n<p>Shipping and Delivery (Shipping)</p>\n<p>Product Size and Quantity (Size)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5714%\"><strong>Jewelry</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.2857%\">\n<p>Accuracy of Product Description (Description)</p>\n<p>Product Appearance (Appearance)</p>\n<p>Customer Service</p>\n<p>Fit and Sizing (Fit)</p>\n<p>Product Packaging (Packaging)</p>\n<p>Product Price and Value (Value)</p>\n<p>Quality</p>\n<p>Shipping and Delivery (Shipping)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5714%\"><strong>Apparel &amp; Accessories</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.2857%\">\n<p>Accuracy of Product Description (Description)</p>\n<p>Product Appearance (Appearance)</p>\n<p>Comfort</p>\n<p>Customer Service</p>\n<p>Fit and Sizing (Fit)</p>\n<p>Product Packaging (Packaging)</p>\n<p>Product Price and Value (Value)</p>\n<p>Quality and Effectiveness (Quality)</p>\n<p>Shipping and Delivery (Shipping)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5714%\"><strong>Sporting Goods</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.2857%\">\n<p>Website Description (Description)</p>\n<p>Product Appearance (Appearance)</p>\n<p>Customer Service</p>\n<p>Ease of Use</p>\n<p>Fit and Sizing (Fit)</p>\n<p>Product Packaging (Packaging)</p>\n<p>Product Price and Value (Value)</p>\n<p>Quality and Effectiveness (Quality)</p>\n<p>Shipping and Delivery (Shipping)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>",
