          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/29581568550299-Understanding-how-reviews-sentiment-trends-are-calculated#h_01J8SSY2V767CG611JBR9GRCDV",
          "text": "How to opt in to sentiment trend analysis"
